 orgate and Barking. c2c services will not operate on Boxing Day but operat
 e between Fenchurch Street\, Limehouse\, West Ham\, Barking and Upminster 
 on other days (no trains to/from Liverpool Street). Replacement bus servic
 e DL7 operates between East Ham\, Barking and Upney.\n\nSource: TfL planne
